    "Peter Thiel returns to the Midas List for a 16th time as the cofounder and general partner of venture fund Founders Fund.",
    "Among its investments are Stripe and SpaceX, two of the most valuable unicorns in the world; Stripe was valued at $159 billion as of February 2026; SpaceX is planning to go public this summer at a valuation of $1.75 trillion.",
